        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Assembly, generator and motor, Mini CHP plant
Inventory based on information from manufacturer (Ecopower 1997;
UUID: e294f127-dcc7-3474-a149-e277c34e85c3
The module includes the most important materials used for production. It includes also the transport of these materials and the energy and water needed for production.
Location: Could be used for central European conditions.
Technology: Specific manufacturer (Ecopower in Switzerland)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e294f127-dcc7-3474-a149-e277c34e85c3.xml</text>
